   <refbody>    <section>
      <p>Tables should include headers for
        context:<codeblock xml:space="preserve" id="codeblock_dh1_2ly_kkc">&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tgroup cols="2"&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;row&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Setting&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Description&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;/row&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;row&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Timeout&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Connection timeout in seconds&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;/row&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/tgroup&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</codeblock></p>
    </section></refbody>
